  RootNode:
    dialogueText: Hey have I seen you here before?<0.3> </>How are you walking so
      easily like that! Are you a traveler??
    responses:
    - responseText: Yes, what is this place?
      nextNode:
        dialogueText: The undergrowth. I'm surprised you didn't manage to read the
          massive text show up as you walked in!
        responses:
        - responseText: Can you tell me about it
          nextNode:
            dialogueText: We're ruled by a pretty lazy king, I mean just look around,
              no one's cut the grass in years!
            responses:
            - responseText: Next
